## hermes auth 真值 (mem0 context + Q28 查官方真值)

`hermes auth` CLI 子命令 (Hermes v2026.8.3 真值):
- `hermes auth add <provider> --api-key <KEY>` - 添加 manual API key (本次仿)
- `hermes auth add <provider>` - OAuth flow (nous / openai-codex / qwen-oauth / minimax-oauth)
- `hermes auth list` - 列出 stored credentials (本次仿)
- `hermes auth status` - 查看 active provider health (本次不仿, 下轮)
- `hermes auth reset <provider>` - 清 429/503 exhaustion (本次不仿, 下轮)
- `hermes auth remove <provider> <index>` - 删除 credentials (本次不仿, 下轮)
- `hermes auth logout <provider>` - 登出 (本次不仿, 下轮)

`~/.hermes/auth.json` credential pool 真值:
- 多 key per provider + priority-based selection (priority 0 最高)
- auto-rotation on 429/503 failures
- fallback chain (`hermes fallback add`)
- per-key status tracking (last_status=ok / 429 / 503 等)

wenshu 当前真值 (Q20 不动):
- ProviderKeychain (Apple Security framework, 真验 `saveKey 后 loadKey 返一致` pass + `重复 saveKey 替换旧 key` pass)
- Provider / ProviderKeychain / ProviderFetcher / ProviderCatalog / MiniMaxModelFetcher (后端核心)
- wenshu 不学 hermes `~/.hermes/auth.json` 文件方案 (Q40 撤回操作链教训 + CLAUDE.md L42)

